{"4202040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drunken Cowboys", "steam_appid": 4202040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your friends are already waiting in the saloon!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet up in the saloon, have fun, choose your drinks, drink up, and decide where you want to head next!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/6e5b8313ae2fec9f7b7c37af44902446.poster.avif?t=1773904500\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/6e5b8313ae2fec9f7b7c37af44902446.webm?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/6e5b8313ae2fec9f7b7c37af44902446.mp4?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don’t forget about your revolver’s cylinder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The revolver’s cylinder is an extension of you, cowboy! Spin it, load your bullets, make sure there are no rounds with debuffs - only ones with positive effects!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/cd9e62b77930bbcf28e3f936a71e6759.poster.avif?t=1773904500\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/cd9e62b77930bbcf28e3f936a71e6759.webm?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/cd9e62b77930bbcf28e3f936a71e6759.mp4?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash unique bullet abilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the drink you choose, the bullets you load into the cylinder can learn to explode, ricochet, scatter, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/7fe2fe6b9ddcaafde192e87d9c04fb56.poster.avif?t=1773904500\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/7fe2fe6b9ddcaafde192e87d9c04fb56.webm?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/7fe2fe6b9ddcaafde192e87d9c04fb56.mp4?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there’s a whole lot more chaos waiting in Dunken Cowboys! Don’t miss out - add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The game is currently in active development, and the materials shown do not reflect the final state of the game.</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your friends are already waiting in the saloon!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet up in the saloon, have fun, choose your drinks, drink up, and decide where you want to head next!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/6e5b8313ae2fec9f7b7c37af44902446.poster.avif?t=1773904500\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/6e5b8313ae2fec9f7b7c37af44902446.webm?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/6e5b8313ae2fec9f7b7c37af44902446.mp4?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don’t forget about your revolver’s cylinder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The revolver’s cylinder is an extension of you, cowboy! Spin it, load your bullets, make sure there are no rounds with debuffs - only ones with positive effects!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/cd9e62b77930bbcf28e3f936a71e6759.poster.avif?t=1773904500\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/cd9e62b77930bbcf28e3f936a71e6759.webm?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/cd9e62b77930bbcf28e3f936a71e6759.mp4?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash unique bullet abilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the drink you choose, the bullets you load into the cylinder can learn to explode, ricochet, scatter, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/7fe2fe6b9ddcaafde192e87d9c04fb56.poster.avif?t=1773904500\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/7fe2fe6b9ddcaafde192e87d9c04fb56.webm?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4202040/extras/7fe2fe6b9ddcaafde192e87d9c04fb56.mp4?t=1773904500\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there’s a whole lot more chaos waiting in Dunken Cowboys! Don’t miss out - add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_parag